func shortestPath(start string,labs map[string]bool,edges []edge,cooled,capacity bool)([]edge,string,int,bool){dist:=map[string]int{start:0};prev:=map[string]edge{};seen:=map[string]bool{};for{cur:="";best:=int(^uint(0)>>1);for id,d:=range dist{if !seen[id]&&d<best{cur=id;best=d}};if cur==""{break};if labs[cur]{path:=[]edge{};for cur!=start{x,ok:=prev[cur];if !ok{return nil,"",0,false};path=append(path,x);cur=x.From};for i,j:=0,len(path)-1;i<j;i,j=i+1,j-1{path[i],path[j]=path[j],path[i]};return path,pathLab(start,path),best,true};seen[cur]=true;for _,x:=range edges{if x.From!=cur||cooled&&!x.Cooled{continue};if capacity&&((cooled&&x.CooledAvailable<1)||(!cooled&&x.RegularAvailable<1)){continue};nd:=best+x.Minutes;if d,ok:=dist[x.To];!ok||nd<d{dist[x.To]=nd;prev[x.To]=x}}};return nil,"",0,false}
func pathLab(start string,path []edge)string{if len(path)==0{return start};return path[len(path)-1].To}

func (a *App) createRequest(w http.ResponseWriter,r *http.Request,presealed bool)error{allowed:=[]string{"requester"};if presealed{allowed=[]string{"collection_professional","delivery_partner","node_handler","laboratory_team"}};u,e:=requireRole(r,allowed...);if e!=nil{return e};var in collectionRequest;if e=decode(r,&in);e!=nil{return e};if presealed&&in.OriginType=="home"{return fail(400,"invalid_origin_type","pre-sealed samples cannot originate at home")};if !presealed&&in.OriginType=="node"{return fail(400,"invalid_origin_type","collection requests must originate at a home or clinic")};sr:=serviceRequest{Origin:in.Origin,OriginType:in.OriginType,OriginNodeID:in.OriginNodeID,SampleTypeID:in.SampleTypeID,RequestedAt:in.RequestedAt,DeliveryDeadline:in.DeliveryDeadline,EarliestCollectionAt:in.EarliestCollectionAt,LatestCollectionAt:in.LatestCollectionAt};rr,e:=a.serviceability(r.Context(),sr);if e!=nil{return e};if in.ContainerType!=rr.Rule.Container||in.TemperatureMinC!=rr.Rule.Min||in.TemperatureMaxC!=rr.Rule.Max{return fail(400,"handling_mismatch","handling attributes must match sample type")};requester:=u.ID;if presealed&&in.RequesterID!=""{requester=in.RequesterID};earliest:=in.EarliestCollectionAt;if earliest==""{earliest=in.RequestedAt};latest:=in.LatestCollectionAt;if latest==""{latest=in.DeliveryDeadline};requestID,sampleID:=uuid(),uuid();response:=map[string]any{"requestId":requestID,"sampleId":sampleID,"serviceability":map[bool]string{true:"serviceable",false:"unserviceable"}[rr.Serviceable],"activeAssignmentIds":[]string{},"earliestCollectionAt":earliest,"latestCollectionAt":latest,"alreadySealed":presealed};originType:=in.OriginType;if originType==""{originType="home"};response["originType"]=originType;if rr.Reason!="serviceable"{response["serviceabilityReason"]=rr.Reason}
